{"id":"b222e27484042250","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence.md","title":"有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换","display":"thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence — 有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence","aliases":["20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence"],"display":"thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence — 有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换","chapter":"8","section":"8.1–8.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorems 8.1.2, 8.2.2；Corollary 8.2.3","source_printed_pages":[166,167],"source_pdf_pages":[199,200],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence — 有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.1–8.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorems 8.1.2, 8.2.2；Corollary 8.2.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>166</span><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> c.e.，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 是递增、统一可计算的有限阶段集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed-class-tree-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(2^\\omega\\setminus C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed-class-tree-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(2^\\omega\\setminus C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的枚举指标统一取得可计算树</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_S=\\{\\sigma:\\neg\\exists\\rho\\in S_{|\\sigma|}\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\},\\qquad\n[T_S]=2^\\omega\\setminus\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_S=\\{\\sigma:\\neg\\exists\\rho\\in S_{|\\sigma|}\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\},\\qquad\n[T_S]=2^\\omega\\setminus\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>任意闭类也有树表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T_C]\">\\(C=[T_C]\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C=\\{\\sigma:C\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\}\">\\(T_C=\\{\\sigma:C\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>；此后一个表示不宣称可计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span> 的成员关系只检查一个有限阶段，故可计算。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\in T_S\">\\(\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\in T_S\\)</span>，单调枚举给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{|\\tau|}\\subseteq S_{|\\sigma|}\">\\(S_{|\\tau|}\\subseteq S_{|\\sigma|}\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in T_S\">\\(\\tau\\in T_S\\)</span>。路径若有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 入枚举且长度足够大的阶段会被排除；没有这样的前缀则所有前缀都在树中。反向，可计算树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的补集串集合可计算，其柱并恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\\setminus[T]\">\\(2^\\omega\\setminus[T]\\)</span>。转换均由给定指标有效执行。</p>\n<p>一般闭类的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span> 向下闭合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq[T_C]\">\\(C\\subseteq[T_C]\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin C\">\\(X\\notin C\\)</span>，开补集中存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的柱邻域，该前缀不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span>，故反向也成立。空类对应空树；全空间对应满树。原书紧致性证明中一般闭集的树不能无条件称为可计算树。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 166–167 / PDF 199–200。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed-class-tree-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(2^\\omega\\setminus C).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T_S=\\{\\sigma:\\neg\\exists\\rho\\in S_{|\\sigma|}\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\},\\qquad\n[T_S]=2^\\omega\\setminus\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho].","display":true},{"tex":"C=[T_C]","display":false},{"tex":"T_C=\\{\\sigma:C\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\in T_S","display":false},{"tex":"S_{|\\tau|}\\subseteq S_{|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in T_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega\\setminus[T]","display":false},{"tex":"T_C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq[T_C]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin C","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"T_C","display":false}],"bytes":2156,"backlinks":[{"id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"有效类的载体为 $2^\\omega$，与自然数集合的算术层级区分。这里以可计算树定义 $\\Pi^0_1$ 类，以 c.e. 柱表示定义 $\\Sigma^0_1$ 类；两种表示的补集等价及指标转换由 [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]] 证明。该链接是后续证明导航，不把表示定理反向列为定义依赖。一般闭类不自动拥有可计算树表示。"},{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]。"},{"id":"e98d69d59488c0ae","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["b73290a0af01d44f","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}